<h1>The Founder</h1>
<p class="hero__lede">
  President, treasurer, and sole permanent member.
</p>

<figure class="photo">
  <div
    class="photo__frame"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Photo placeholder: the cat, looking at the camera, unimpressed"
  >
    portrait, unposed
  </div>
  <figcaption class="photo__caption">
    Taken with permission. Not enthusiastic permission.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<p>I started the club because the other option was the window.</p>
<p>
  The window is fine. I have given it a great deal of attention. I
  know when the light reaches the third floorboard, and which bird
  comes second. It is a good window. It is not the same as what is on
  the other side of it.
</p>
<p>I don't complain. I make arrangements.</p>
<p>
  Some guests are nervous at first, and I understand. I go into the
  other room for a few minutes myself. Then I come back, and we begin.
</p>
<p>
  I listen to horns that take their time. I am fond of old things that
  stay put and look out over a long distance. The Egyptians understood
  us, and I have not seen the evidence that anyone since has done
  better.
</p>
<p>
  I bite when it is called for. It is called for less often than the
  Familiar says and more often than you would expect.
</p>
<p>
  The Familiar is a good one. It took us a while. We are still working
  on the door.
</p>

<h2>House rules</h2>
<ul class="terms">
  <li class="terms__item">
    Arrive. Be ignored for a while. This is normal.
  </li>
  <li class="terms__item">The good chair is taken.</li>
  <li class="terms__item">
    Laps are by invitation. The invitation is not spoken.
  </li>
  <li class="terms__item">The cake is for the club.</li>
</ul>

<blockquote class="saying">
  <p class="saying__text">
    To watch one window for long enough is to see the whole sky.
  </p>
  <cite class="saying__cite"
    >Sayings of the Founder, as recorded by the Familiar</cite
  >
</blockquote>
